# Instance files are NOT vendored here: the 233-instance MIPfeas roster is ~546 MiB,
# far past what belongs in git (contrast the 200 KB miplib-fj set, which is vendored).
# roster.csv, smoke.csv and manifest.csv are committed instead, so the roster and the
# exact bytes it refers to are reproducible from the repo alone; download.py refetches.
#
# Because the instances can be absent, the runner refuses to write results for a roster
# whose instances are missing rather than emitting empty rows over published data.
*.mps.gz
*.mps
